## Summary table

| Artifact | Stored? | Computed where | When recomputed | Used for |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `payload.tags` | Yes (DB) | `ExtractAll` → `RebuildMemoPayload` | Create; update `content` | Filters, sidebar tags |
| `payload.property.*` | Yes (DB) | `ExtractAll` → `RebuildMemoPayload` | Create; update `content` | Filters, stats, shortcuts |
| `payload.location` | Yes (DB) | User API input | Create/update `location` | Map, location display |
| `snippet` | **No** | `GenerateSnippet` at read time | Every API response | List/comment/relation previews |
